<p>In April 1996, the Company sold substantially all of its assets to Thermatrix Inc., a San Jose, CA based environmental technology company, and entered into a five-year agreement not to compete with Thermatrix.  The Company is currently searching for a new business or technology to acquire as it phases out of the air pollution control business.</p>
